  "summary": "Compiles a relation AST into backend-native operations. UnifiedRelationVisitor walks RelationNodes, dispatches through the RelationOperationRegistry to a backend RelationSystem, delegates embedded expressions to the expression visitor, applies capability gating, and reuses compiled subtrees within a session. RelationVisitRegistry is the type-keyed extension surface for registering visit handlers for third-party node types, protecting built-in Substrait nodes from override.",
